===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|gratuliert|gratulierte|gratuliert|haben}}

# {{context|intransitive|+ dative}} to [[congratulate]]
#: ''Ich gratuliere dir.'' – “I congratulate you.”

====Usage notes====
* That '''on''' which someone is congratulated is given with the preposition {{term|zu|lang=de}}: ''Ich gratuliere dir '''zu''' deinem Geburtstag.'' – “I congratulate you '''on''' your birthday.”

